{"screen_name": "mona_monaki", "file": "mona_monaki-f495be", "name": "もなき", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1928064761511731200/ERgeNS_K.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1504474527543480325/1748361034/1500x500", "description": "雑多！イラスト依頼はDMへ！open commission！", "total_works": 13, "scraped_works": 13, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T21:09:38.662955+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T21:09:38.662955+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 10000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T21:09:38.662955+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 10000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 10000, "max": 10000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/mona_monaki", "name": "mona_monaki"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@mona_monaki/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1c72b7e9/uploads/origins/9c793eb1-d2e9-4439-949e-bf8215144b81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=154c44b85cfbf7a2255f55d4adaea98c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1c72b7e9/uploads/origins/9c793eb1-d2e9-4439-949e-bf8215144b81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=154c44b85cfbf7a2255f55d4adaea98c, https://si.imgix.net/1c72b7e9/uploads/origins/9c793eb1-d2e9-4439-949e-bf8215144b81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a44574d365bf7f9362818c00a4cd3788 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1c72b7e9/uploads/origins/9c793eb1-d2e9-4439-949e-bf8215144b81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5be2037be22962b86f4f84a1ad095785 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私はあなたの絵がとても好きで、私のOCであるカメリアと一緒に作品を依頼したいと思っています。\n\nカメリアの服装は、用意されている服装でも、新しい服装でもかまいません。\n\nご配慮とお時間をありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vj8ZMYWALQTvjounROsyF0YWJeuL7-cp?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mona_monaki/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/37a1786d/uploads/